# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# No SPA catch-all here on purpose. Pages already resolves an unknown path to
# /index.html with a 200 for this kind of project (verified against
# `wrangler pages dev`: /work and /some/deep/link both return the shell).
#
# A `/*  /index.html  200` rule is actively wrong on Pages — it is rejected at
# deploy time as an infinite loop, because resolving /index.html re-enters the
# same rule. Wrangler logs it as an invalid rule and ignores it, so you'd ship
# believing you had a fallback that does not exist.
#
# Real 301s go here, above nothing, e.g.:
# /old-path    /new-path    301
